## Claude LaunchAgent - skip on machines with no claude_default
{{- $claudeDefault := includeTemplate "machine-config" (merge (dict "setting" "claude_default") .) }}
{{- if not $claudeDefault }}
Library/LaunchAgents/{{ .reverse_dns }}.claude-config-dir.plist
{{- end }}

## Cloudflare Tunnel SOPS-decrypted targets - skip until the age key exists
## (run_onchange_after_darwin-43-setup-age-key.sh.tmpl writes it; template
## rendering during Read() is not ordered relative to script execution, so
## these targets are unreachable via sopsDecrypt on a fresh machine's first
## apply — see openspec/changes/harden-chezmoi-bootstrap-and-permissions/design.md
## Decision 2). A second `chezmoi apply` picks them up once the key exists.
{{- $ageKeyPath := joinPath .chezmoi.homeDir "Library" "Application Support" "sops" "age" "keys.txt" }}
{{- if not (stat $ageKeyPath) }}
.cloudflared/cert.pem
.cloudflared/f2ab9336-44f9-4bfc-8c2e-5696fc9bc2e4.json
{{- end }}
